  m_Name: D_Good
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: PlateCheck::PlateCheck.Data.CounselingOptionData
  text: Lots of people have that habit, and you already have salad and chicken here. Would you try milk or water instead of soda, and rice instead of fries, a few days a week?
  quality: 0
  clientReaction: Milk a few days a week sounds doable. I'll try it.
  explanation: Normalizes the habit, points out what is already good, and offers specific, gradual swaps the client can choose.
